        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;northstar-dev-MLEngineer permissions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trust: sagemaker.amazonaws.com&lt;br&gt;• SageMaker: training jobs, endpoints, MLflow App, model registry, Studio self-service (describe Domain and profile; create, list, delete own apps and spaces)&lt;br&gt;• S3: read/write artifacts/ and features/&lt;br&gt;• CloudWatch Logs: write&lt;br&gt;• ECR: read (pull training container images)&lt;br&gt;• Denied by omission: cannot write raw/ or processed/&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lab 1 places Studio in the public subnet for simplicity; Lab 2 moves it to a private subnet with a NAT gateway. DataEngineer and ModelMonitor roles are added in Lab 2.&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFF5F5;strokeColor=#DD344C;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="860" width="690" height="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
